cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or analysis, please cite the accompanying editorial."
type: software
title: "jcheminf-editorial-2026: code and data for Figure 1 of 'Cheminformatics as a core driver of molecular discovery and design'"
abstract: >
  Topic-evolution analysis of all Journal of Cheminformatics articles published
  2015–2025 (n = 1,050), based on non-negative matrix factorisation of titles
  and abstracts retrieved from PubMed. Includes the analysis script, raw input,
  per-year-per-topic counts, the rendered figure, and an extended methods
  description.
